      "updated": 1792781143674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Copy-on-write: to change a file\nthat came from the image, Docker\nfirst copies it up into the\ncontainer's layer, then changes\nthe copy. The image's file stays\nas it was.\n\ndocker rm throws the writable\nlayer away. The image is\nuntouched, so the next container\nstarts fresh.",
      "originalText": "Copy-on-write: to change a file\nthat came from the image, Docker\nfirst copies it up into the\ncontainer's layer, then changes\nthe copy. The image's file stays\nas it was.\n\ndocker rm throws the writable\nlayer away. The image is\nuntouched, so the next container\nstarts fresh.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
